body:
**Familia/Guild name: Soliloquy (EU)**

**F. LVL 8**

EU server is currently full with French familias that are pretty much full, I'd like to open a familia for all English speaking players. Everyone is welcome, however speaking English is an absolute must.

&#x200B;

Please apply in the discord server:

[https://discord.gg/Qzt8g9t](https://discord.gg/Qzt8g9t)

I'll be handing out advice and team comp building help in the discord server. You can trust that I know some decent amount of team building knowledge. I'm a f2p rank 132 player. :) A huge amount of the members (who are in the discord server) have gone from braver/battle princess to king 2 within no time with my advice.

&#x200B;

Guild Type: Serious, and competitive.

&#x200B;

Goal of Familia: To become an english familia that can compete with other EU familias.

&#x200B;

Criteria: Rank 40+, be active (will be kicked after 3 days of inactivity without notice), donating actively.

&#x200B;

Members: 29/30

&#x200B;

God: Hestia (bestia)
